# LaTeX / BibTeX build products (sources: *.tex *.bib *.py Makefile *.md remain tracked)
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex.gz(busy)
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*-blx.bib

# Marp build products other than the tracked main.pdf: the HTML export and the
# per-slide PNGs from `make png` / `make html` (review aids, regenerated at will).
main.html
main.[0-9][0-9][0-9].png

# Re-include rendered decks and figures. The repo-root .gitignore has broad
# *.pdf and *.png rules; without these exceptions a deck's main.pdf and its
# figures would be silently ignored. Marp cannot embed PDF figures, so deck
# figures are PNG (renders) or SVG (plots); fig_*.pdf is kept for parity with
# docs/experiments/ in case a report figure is copied across.
!main.pdf
!fig_*.png
!fig_*.svg
!fig_*.pdf
